\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de telem\u00f3vel operacional, recipiente pr\u00f3prio para l\u00edquidos, documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o e lanterna frontal, visto que os tro\u00e7os finais decorrem em per\u00edodo noturno.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e fotografias oficiais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es finais e as galerias fotogr\u00e1ficas do evento ser\u00e3o disponibilizadas na plataforma acorrer.pt e partilhadas no portal Portugal Running ap\u00f3s o t\u00e9rmino da competi\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66131,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,1354],"event_type_2":[727,820,102],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-59219","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-lamego","event_type-trail","event_type-backyard-2","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-viseu"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/last-man-n-s-dos-remedios-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/59219","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=59219"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/59219\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id